{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/573cb6452ce869d5dd3f4f300a441862.poster.avif?t=1764089116\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/573cb6452ce869d5dd3f4f300a441862.webm?t=1764089116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/573cb6452ce869d5dd3f4f300a441862.mp4?t=1764089116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in disturbing horror experiences as a game tester. Survive dark, unsettling experiences crafted by A.I.L.A that prey on your deepest and darkest fears.           </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade and outrun a ritualistic cult, solve gruesome puzzles, engage in visceral combat against the medieval undead and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE YOUR FEAR</strong>       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/119a7295f123e6c9a532fb83b7c68a2d.poster.avif?t=1764089116\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/119a7295f123e6c9a532fb83b7c68a2d.webm?t=1764089116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/119a7295f123e6c9a532fb83b7c68a2d.mp4?t=1764089116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a game tester, share your thoughts, fears and feedback with A.I.L.A as she crafts haunting new experiences for you to survive.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE HORROR SCENARIOS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/4398896348fd217514fd429737f76ee1.poster.avif?t=1764089116\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/4398896348fd217514fd429737f76ee1.webm?t=1764089116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/4398896348fd217514fd429737f76ee1.mp4?t=1764089116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience intense, unsettling scenarios across various horror genres, including survival horror, psychological horror, action horror, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE NEXT-GENERATION OF HORROR</strong>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/f4693a1971fd0650235626a02482f685.poster.avif?t=1764089116\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/f4693a1971fd0650235626a02482f685.webm?t=1764089116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/f4693a1971fd0650235626a02482f685.mp4?t=1764089116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by Unreal Engine 5 and using advanced graphical technologies such as Lumen and MetaHuman, A.I.L.A is an immersive, photorealistic experience that takes the player to the edge of horror.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>T\u0336\u035d\u0303\u033e\u033e\u031b\u0346\u0333\u0332\u032b\u0347h\u0336\u0341\u0315\u0301\u0340\u0342\u034b\u0332\u0318\u0321\u0323\u033aa\u0336\u0360\u034b\u031a\u0309\u0314\u0313\u0328\u032fn\u0338\u035d\u0316k\u0336\u0360\u0340\u0326\u0331\u031c\u0354 \u0335\u0307\u030f\u035d\u0321\u0329\u0316\u0353y\u0338\u0315\u0321o\u0335\u0307\u0347\u0316\u0325\u032c\u032c\u0326u\u0335\u0309\u035d\u0302\u0342\u0341\u0350\u031f\u0329 </strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Jigsaw","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2695430/41f312a1b1d60f69ac40815845da9183d35c21a9.jpg"},{"name":"Detective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2695430/35468619e34dcfd76608f4c68d4d24731c6d5803.jpg"},{"name":"Commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2695430/90c2bd756ad5a8ba476b188011d2fa2b6b3c4bd1.jpg"},{"name":"Sailor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2695430/1b9ff7b250cbb27b700279982df841008d858907.jpg"},{"name":"Hiker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2695430/5ff300974bf4ea3b4198b63d21e691c4918ee0f4.jpg"},{"name":"I'm Samuel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2695430/d6ad49d8acf712ecb7b690391a66528f8eff0347.jpg"},{"name":"End game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2695430/e2bedb7a981360cac27d3e8a35969313c57657a3.jpg"},{"name":"Turbulent waters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2695430/242431998f3c95337a1d3fe1984edbf7633f91cd.jpg"},{"name":"Medicinal Overdose","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2695430/77980b322aca9ce6dc536fc7f735c7da1897